\
Thank you. Here is the additional information for Tendora.\
\
1. Screen recording\
I will attach a screen recording captured on a physical device. The recording begins with launching the app and shows the normal user flow:\
- onboarding\
- creating and editing assets\
- creating and editing maintenance tasks\
- enabling reminder notifications\
- importing photo and file attachments\
- opening, sharing, and deleting attachments\
- viewing the Calendar and Documents screens\
\
The app has:\
- no login or account creation\
- no subscriptions or in-app purchases\
- no user-generated public content\
- no App Tracking Transparency prompt\
\
2. Devices and operating systems tested\
Tested on physical devices:\
- iPhone 15 Pro, iOS 26.6.1\
- iPad (10th generation), iPadOS 27.0\
\
The app was installed on iPhone through TestFlight for testing.\
\
3. App function and target audience\
Tendora is a local-first maintenance tracking app for people who want to organize homes, cabins, cars, boats, and other personal assets. It helps users track maintenance tasks, reminders, documents, photos, and maintenance history in one place.\
\
4. Setup and access to main features\
No login is required.\
Main features are available immediately after launch.\
To use the app:\
- create an asset\
- add maintenance tasks\
- optionally enable reminder notifications\
- optionally import photos or files as attachments\
\
No demo credentials are required.\
No sample files are required, but local photos and files can be imported using the system pickers.\
\
5. External services, tools, or platforms\
Tendora does not rely on external services for its core functionality.\
It uses:\
- on-device local storage\
- Apple local notification APIs\
- Apple photo picker\
- Apple file importer\
- Apple Quick Look / share sheet\
\
It does not use third-party authentication, payments, analytics, ads, AI services, or cloud backend services in version 1.0.\
\
6. Regional differences\
There are no regional differences in features or content. The app functions consistently across all regions.\
\
7. Regulated industries or protected third-party material\
Tendora does not operate in a highly regulated industry and does not provide regulated services. Users may import their own local files and photos for personal organization.\
\
Please let us know if any further information is needed.\
\
